### 基本示例 - 获取用户列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/users
Accept: application/json

###

### 获取特定用户信息
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/users/123
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### 创建新用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "张三",
  "email": "zhangsan@example.com",
  "age": 30,
  "department": "技术部"
}

###

### 更新用户信息
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/users/123
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "李四",
  "email": "lisi@example.com",
  "age": 28,
  "department": "产品部"
}

###

### 删除用户
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/users/123
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### 搜索用户（带查询参数）
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/users/search?name=张&department=技术部&page=1&limit=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

###

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json